WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.740
There is no such thing

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.800
as a global anthem,

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.540
a global currency,

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.780
or a global flag.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.940
This is the United States of America

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.140
that I'm representing.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.740
I'm not representing the globe.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.240
I am representing

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.060
your country.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.280
Donald Trump has promised

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.420
to make America great again

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.400
by putting America first.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.500
Though he was speaking at the

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.520
Conservative Political Action Conference,

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.400
or CPAC,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.620
it's gotta be said that

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:29.720
he is no small-government conservative.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.400
In fact, his speech made clear

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.540
that he represents the worst tendencies

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.280
of conservative Republicans and liberal Democrats

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.060
to limit our freedoms in the name

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:40.520
of supposedly serving the greater good.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:42.160
Trump is an economic protectionist

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.220
and interventionist,

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.020
who wants to promote what he perceives

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.120
are "our values."

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.120
by building a wall to keep out immigrants,

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:49.640
charging tariffs on imports,

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.640
badgering US companies to stay here,

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.400
and making pipelines with only American steel.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.400
All of that will only make everything cost more

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.160
while reducing employment.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.280
The GOP

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.020
will be

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.700
from now on

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.080
the party,

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.240
also,

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:07.760
of the American worker.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.060
He talks about bringing back manufacturing jobs,

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:11.000
but they peaked as a

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.660
percentage of the workforce in 1943

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.060
and are never coming back

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:16.420
for a very good reason.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:18.420
Thanks to technological innovation,

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:21.300
manufacturing output has doubled since the 1980s

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.540
but with 1/3rd fewer workers.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:24.760
Shutting down free trade

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.420
or playing CEO-in-chief is not going to change that.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.920
At the heart of Trump's confusion

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.940
is his belief that putting America First

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:33.140
means keeping the world at a distance.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:34.980
But you can be a citizen of America

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.680
and a citizen of the world.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:39.080
In fact, if you believe in political, economic,

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.000
and cultural freedom,

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.740
you must always hold such dual citizenship.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.180
There's no more basic freedom than the right to live

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.180
where you want and buy what you want.

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:48.840
That's not anti-America.

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.380
That is America.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:51.900
In different ways over the years,

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:54.100
Republicans and Democrats have tried to control

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.840
where we can live, who we can marry,

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.740
what we can eat, drink, and smoke, and so much more.

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:01.280
Trump represents not a release from such thinking

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:02.540
but a shotgun marriage

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:04.480
of that worst impulse in each party.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:05.320
We're going to win,

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:06.300
we're going to win big folks,

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.380
we're going to start winning again, believe me.

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.120
We're going to win.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.640
"Where liberty dwells, there is my country,"

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:13.820
Ben Franklin is said to have written.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:15.400
In putting America First,

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.660
Donald Trump will succeed

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.880
only in leaving even more of us truly homeless.

